  1394	    surface either. The cure is version-NEUTRAL prose, not a new writer row
  1395	    (a writer with no oracle is the dead rule `_release_bump_sites.py`
  1396	    already refuses to reintroduce)."""
  1397	    assert NPM_DOC_SURFACES, "no npm doc is scanned — the P1-2 surface is unwatched"
  1398	
  1399	    # Positive control FIRST, in a throwaway tree, and planted in the SAME
  1400	    # relative paths the real scan uses: this proves the SURFACE is covered,
  1401	    # not merely that the regex can match a version somewhere. The stamped
  1402	    # file rides along because an over-firing control gets exempted away
