   Concrete failure: T-2 is conservatively deferred, not cured: `_is_harness_probe_event` always returns false, so a probe-only window remains `1/1 red`. Its docstring nevertheless says positively identified probes are skipped and reported through `harness_probes_skipped`, a counter removed from the implementation.  
   Minimal fix: immediately correct the docstring; enable exemption only after the emitter supplies non-caller-forgeable provenance.

